# City goal "Muni Hop": rolling west across Church St at 7 m/s, a full ollie from east of the J-Church
# tracks to past the first pair: the MUNI HOP gap (an air gap, box to box) and the goal. (On Church St
# north of 18th in the squeezed city, where the cars parked on the west side leave a gap.)
park sf
spawn valencia_shops
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 teleport -429.5 29.5 9.81 270
cmd 20 set skater.vel.x -7
hold ollie 20..100
run 300
expect event gap{id=muni_hop_w,points=400} within 210..225
expect event goalComplete{id=munihop,area=Church} within 210..225
expect no event bail
